-- Enriched views live in the registered table's own schema (public), not in
-- the extension, so they are not extension members -- CASCADE is required
-- and expected, the same as dropping any table other objects depend on.
-- Extension-owned objects (helix_ai itself and everything in it) are still
-- removed cleanly.
DROP EXTENSION helix CASCADE;
NOTICE:  drop cascades to 32 other objects
DETAIL:  drop cascades to view widgets_ai
drop cascades to view order_lines_ai
drop cascades to view owned_by_other_ai
drop cascades to view notes_ai
drop cascades to view docs_ai
drop cascades to view k3_items_ai
drop cascades to view k3_docs_ai
drop cascades to view k3_notes_ai
drop cascades to view k3_jobs_table_ai
drop cascades to view k3_secrets_ai
drop cascades to view k3_gen_ai
drop cascades to view k3_dl_ai
drop cascades to view k3_scope_a_ai
drop cascades to view k3_scope_b_ai
drop cascades to view k3_input_ai
drop cascades to view k3_refresh_auth_ai
drop cascades to trigger helix_ai_capture on table widgets
drop cascades to trigger helix_ai_capture on table order_lines
drop cascades to trigger helix_ai_capture on table owned_by_other
drop cascades to trigger helix_ai_capture on table notes
drop cascades to trigger helix_ai_capture on table docs
drop cascades to trigger helix_ai_capture on table k3_items
drop cascades to trigger helix_ai_capture on table k3_docs
drop cascades to trigger helix_ai_capture on table k3_notes
drop cascades to trigger helix_ai_capture on table k3_jobs_table
drop cascades to trigger helix_ai_capture on table k3_secrets
drop cascades to trigger helix_ai_capture on table k3_gen
drop cascades to trigger helix_ai_capture on table k3_dl
drop cascades to trigger helix_ai_capture on table k3_scope_a
drop cascades to trigger helix_ai_capture on table k3_scope_b
drop cascades to trigger helix_ai_capture on table k3_input
drop cascades to trigger helix_ai_capture on table k3_refresh_auth
